Fonts:

No font binary is committed to this repository. `node generators/media/fonts.mjs` downloads the
free, openly-licensed faces (OFL 1.1 / Apache) from Fontsource at build time,
into the gitignored assets/fonts/: Inter, Geist, Geist Mono, IBM Plex Mono, JetBrains Mono,
Plus Jakarta Sans, Hanken Grotesk, Archivo, Caveat, Space Grotesk, Instrument
Serif (all OFL 1.1).

Sohne (Klim Type Foundry) is a paid face and is never distributed. It is
used locally only for brand-fidelity captures; supply your own copy at
assets/fonts/local/Sohne.woff2.

Icon and photo sources:

- Icons: Lucide (ISC) under assets/icons/ui/ and the Markdown mark (CC0)
  are committed. Third-party brand logos are not committed: they are
  trademarks, kept local and gitignored.

- Flags: flagcdn.com, public domain. Committed under assets/flags/.

- Photos: CC0 / CC-BY via the photo fetcher; CC-BY credits are recorded per
  video. Fetched on demand, not committed.

Sound effects:

Every cue is synthesized from parameters in core/audio/kit.mjs when a film
renders: no download, no license, byte-identical on every machine. The
optional `node generators/media/audio-bake.mjs` writes them to the gitignored assets/sfx/. A real
sample is an optional OVERRIDE, never a replacement.

See resources/README.md for a list of stock media sites.

Never distributed:

- Sohne (see Fonts above): a paid face, bring-your-own copy only.

- Resource Boy gradient pack (assets/gradients/) and the Ransom letter
  sprites (assets/ransom/, assets/ransom-src/): no-redistribute license.
  Kept local-only and gitignored; the bake recipe is not in this repository.
